  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "When a Gu Master advances to an immortal, the aperture transforms into an immortal aperture. That change is a qualitative evolution, like creating a whole new small world.",
      "chapters": [
        610
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_master"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Without advancing to Gu Immortal, there is no immortal aperture in which to store Immortal Gu such as Calamity Beckoning Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        568
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "sys_immortal_gu",
        "gu_calamity_beckoning_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Immortal apertures of rank six and rank seven are blessed lands. Gu Immortal apertures of rank eight and rank nine are grotto-heavens.",
      "chapters": [
        609
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "At ranks six and seven the immortal aperture is called a blessed land: a vast space akin to a small world.",
      "chapters": [
        622
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "blessed-land-and-grotto-heaven",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Every immortal aperture is unique and is part of the Gu Immortal’s body. If a Gu Immortal dies leaving lingering obsession, that obsession can combine with the heavenly power inside the immortal aperture and become a land spirit.",
      "chapters": [
        610
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unique-body-and-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "A blessed land with a land spirit is the immortal aperture of a fallen Gu Immortal.",
      "chapters": [
        616
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "unique-body-and-land-spirit",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "The immortal aperture, whether blessed land or grotto-heaven, is a small world that contains dao expressed as dao marks. Offense and defense of a blessed land turn on that dao mark composition.",
      "chapters": [
        821
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "dao-and-dao-marks",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Named blessed lands and grotto-heavens as places are covered on blessed lands and grotto-heavens. The pre-immortal form is covered on Mortal Aperture. Ascension itself is covered on immortal ascension.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
